<div class="w-100 pull-left " data-parentid="" id="1609067316773123" data-pp="1" style="position: relative; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #293E9C;margin-top:20px;; text-align: JUSTIFY; "><div style="padding-left: rem; ">8 дугаар зүйл.</div></div>
